    "A Wi-Fi link macOS keeps for things that can't wait, like AirPlay and Sidecar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine WLAN-Verbindung, die macOS für Dinge bereithält, die nicht warten können, etwa AirPlay und Sidecar."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un enlace Wi-Fi que macOS reserva para lo que no puede esperar, como AirPlay y Sidecar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une liaison Wi-Fi que macOS réserve aux usages qui ne peuvent pas attendre, comme AirPlay et Sidecar."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un collegamento Wi-Fi che macOS riserva a ciò che non può aspettare, come AirPlay e Sidecar."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPlayやSidecarのように待たせられない通信のために、macOSが確保しているWi-Fi接続です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPlay나 Sidecar처럼 기다릴 수 없는 작업을 위해 macOS가 유지하는 Wi-Fi 연결입니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Een wifiverbinding die macOS openhoudt voor dingen die niet kunnen wachten, zoals AirPlay en Sidecar."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Um link de Wi-Fi que o macOS mantém para o que não pode esperar, como AirPlay e Sidecar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 为 AirPlay 和 Sidecar 这类不能等待的功能保留的 Wi-Fi 连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 為 AirPlay 和 Sidecar 這類不能等待的功能保留的 Wi-Fi 連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A backup in the Trash can still be put back. Once the Trash is emptied, it's gone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Backup im Papierkorb kannst du noch zurücklegen. Sobald der Papierkorb geleert ist, ist es weg."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una copia de seguridad en la papelera aún se puede recuperar. Cuando se vacía la papelera, desaparece."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une sauvegarde dans la corbeille peut encore être remise en place. Une fois la corbeille vidée, elle disparaît."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un backup nel Cestino si può ancora ripristinare. Una volta svuotato il Cestino, non c’è più."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ゴミ箱にあるバックアップはまだ戻せます。ゴミ箱を空にすると完全になくなります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "휴지통에 있는 백업은 아직 되돌릴 수 있습니다. 휴지통을 비우면 완전히 사라집니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Een reservekopie in de prullenmand kun je nog terugzetten. Zodra de prullenmand is geleegd, is hij weg."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Um backup no Lixo ainda pode ser recuperado. Depois que o Lixo for esvaziado, ele some."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "废纸篓中的备份仍可放回。清倒废纸篓后就无法恢复了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "垃圾桶中的備份仍可放回。清空垃圾桶後就無法復原了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A coding agent's processes holding %@ or more, once per session" : {
      "comment" : "Alert rule summary, e.g. 8 GB or more",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prozesse eines Coding-Agenten belegen %@ oder mehr, einmal pro Sitzung"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los procesos de un agente de programación ocupan %@ o más, una vez por sesión"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les processus d’un agent de code occupent %@ ou plus, une fois par session"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I processi di un agente di programmazione occupano %@ o più, una volta per sessione"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "コーディングエージェントのプロセスが%@以上を使用したとき（セッションごとに1回）"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
