    "A notification when an app hogs the CPU, keeps growing, or hammers the disk or network. Get Started asks macOS to let Mactivity send them." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Mitteilung, wenn eine App die CPU auslastet, immer mehr Speicher belegt oder Festplatte oder Netzwerk stark beansprucht. „Los geht’s“ bittet macOS, Mactivity das Senden zu erlauben."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una notificación cuando una app acapara la CPU, no deja de crecer o sobrecarga el disco o la red. “Empezar” pide a macOS que permita a Mactivity enviarlas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une notification quand une app accapare le processeur, ne cesse de grossir ou sollicite fortement le disque ou le réseau. « Commencer » demande à macOS d’autoriser Mactivity à les envoyer."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una notifica quando un'app monopolizza la CPU, continua a crescere o sovraccarica il disco o la rete. “Inizia” chiede a macOS di consentire a Mactivity di inviarle."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリがCPUを占有したり、メモリ使用量が増え続けたり、ディスクやネットワークを酷使したりすると通知します。“はじめる”を押すと、Mactivityが通知を送信できるようmacOSに許可を求めます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앱이 CPU를 독차지하거나, 메모리 사용량이 계속 늘어나거나, 디스크 또는 네트워크를 과도하게 사용하면 알림을 보냅니다. 시작하기를 누르면 Mactivity가 알림을 보낼 수 있도록 macOS에 허용을 요청합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Een melding als een app de CPU opslokt, blijft groeien of de schijf of het netwerk zwaar belast. ‘Aan de slag’ vraagt macOS om Mactivity toestemming te geven ze te sturen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uma notificação quando um app sobrecarrega a CPU, não para de crescer ou força o disco ou a rede. “Começar” pede ao macOS que permita que o Mactivity as envie."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当某个 App 大量占用 CPU、内存持续增长，或大量使用磁盘或网络时，你会收到通知。点按“开始使用”后，Mactivity 会请求 macOS 允许其发送通知。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當某個 App 大量佔用 CPU、記憶體持續增加，或大量使用磁碟或網路時，你會收到通知。按一下「開始使用」後，Mactivity 會請求 macOS 允許其傳送通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A package with a serious known vulnerability, or no longer getting security fixes; once each" : {
      "comment" : "Alert rule summary",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
