    "AirPods, Magic Mouse, Magic Keyboard and Magic Trackpad show up here with their battery over time. AirPods need Bluetooth access: Settings → Privacy." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods, Magic Mouse, Magic Keyboard und Magic Trackpad erscheinen hier mit ihrem Batterieverlauf. AirPods brauchen Bluetooth-Zugriff: Einstellungen → Datenschutz."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los AirPods, el Magic Mouse, el Magic Keyboard y el Magic Trackpad aparecen aquí con su batería a lo largo del tiempo. Los AirPods necesitan acceso a Bluetooth: Ajustes → Privacidad."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les AirPods, la Magic Mouse, le Magic Keyboard et le Magic Trackpad apparaissent ici avec l’historique de leur batterie. Les AirPods nécessitent l’accès Bluetooth : Réglages → Confidentialité."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods, Magic Mouse, Magic Keyboard e Magic Trackpad compaiono qui con la loro batteria nel tempo. Gli AirPods richiedono l’accesso Bluetooth: Impostazioni → Privacy."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods、Magic Mouse、Magic Keyboard、Magic Trackpadのバッテリーの推移がここに表示されます。AirPodsにはBluetoothへのアクセスが必要です: 設定 → プライバシー。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods, Magic Mouse, Magic Keyboard, Magic Trackpad의 배터리 변화가 여기에 표시됩니다. AirPods에는 Bluetooth 접근 권한이 필요합니다: 설정 → 개인정보 보호."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods, Magic Mouse, Magic Keyboard en Magic Trackpad verschijnen hier met hun batterij door de tijd. Voor AirPods is Bluetooth-toegang nodig: Instellingen → Privacy."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods, Magic Mouse, Magic Keyboard e Magic Trackpad aparecem aqui com a bateria ao longo do tempo. Os AirPods precisam de acesso ao Bluetooth: Ajustes → Privacidade."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods、妙控鼠标、妙控键盘和妙控板会在这里显示电池随时间的变化。AirPods 需要蓝牙访问权限：设置 → 隐私。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods、巧控滑鼠、巧控鍵盤和巧控板會在這裡顯示電池隨時間的變化。AirPods 需要藍牙取用權限：設定 → 隱私。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
