    "Mactivity has only just started recording chargers. Each one you use appears here after it has charged your Mac for a while." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mactivity hat gerade erst begonnen, Netzteile aufzuzeichnen. Jedes, das du nutzt, erscheint hier, nachdem es deinen Mac eine Weile geladen hat."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mactivity acaba de empezar a registrar los cargadores. Cada uno que uses aparecerá aquí después de cargar tu Mac durante un rato."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mactivity vient tout juste de commencer à enregistrer les chargeurs. Chacun de ceux que vous utilisez apparaît ici après avoir chargé votre Mac un moment."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mactivity ha appena iniziato a registrare gli alimentatori. Ognuno di quelli che usi compare qui dopo aver ricaricato il Mac per un po'."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mactivityは充電器の記録を始めたばかりです。使用した充電器は、Macをしばらく充電するとここに表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mactivity가 충전기 기록을 막 시작했습니다. 사용하는 충전기는 Mac을 얼마 동안 충전한 후 여기에 표시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mactivity is net begonnen laders vast te leggen. Elke lader die je gebruikt, verschijnt hier nadat hij je Mac een tijdje heeft opgeladen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Mactivity acabou de começar a registrar os carregadores. Cada um que você usar aparece aqui depois de carregar seu Mac por um tempo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mactivity 刚开始记录充电器。你使用的每个充电器为 Mac 充电一段时间后，就会显示在这里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mactivity 剛開始記錄充電器。你使用的每個充電器為 Mac 充電一段時間後，就會顯示在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mactivity has only just started recording the battery's temperature. The first readings appear here within a few minutes." : {
