    "Your apps only. macOS's own sharing, like Remote Login or Screen Sharing, is in System Settings → General → Sharing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nur deine Apps. Die Freigaben von macOS, etwa „Entfernte Anmeldung“ oder „Bildschirmfreigabe“, findest du in „Systemeinstellungen“ → „Allgemein“ → „Teilen“."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solo tus apps. Lo que comparte macOS, como Sesión remota o Compartir pantalla, está en Ajustes del Sistema → General → Compartir."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vos apps uniquement. Les partages de macOS, comme Session à distance ou Partage d’écran, se trouvent dans Réglages Système → Général → Partage."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solo le tue app. Le condivisioni di macOS, come Login remoto o Condivisione schermo, sono in Impostazioni di Sistema → Generali → Condivisione."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "対象はあなたのアプリのみです。リモートログインや画面共有など、macOS自体の共有は「システム設定」→「一般」→「共有」にあります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "사용자의 앱만 해당됩니다. 원격 로그인이나 화면 공유 같은 macOS 자체 공유는 시스템 설정 → 일반 → 공유에 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alleen je apps. Wat macOS zelf deelt, zoals Inloggen op afstand of Schermdeling, staat in Systeeminstellingen → Algemeen → Delen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apenas seus apps. O compartilhamento do próprio macOS, como Sessão Remota ou Compartilhamento de Tela, fica em Ajustes do Sistema → Geral → Compartilhamento."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅限你的 App。macOS 自身的共享（如远程登录或屏幕共享）位于“系统设置”→“通用”→“共享”。"
